#inherit/misc/bboard.c
dbase (["notes":({(["msg":"/d/wudang/wdroad6 is changed,  old 1 saved as wdroad6.bak/d/wudang/tufeiwo1,tufeiwo2,tufeiwo3 are added./d/wudang/npc/tufei1, tufei2, tufeitou are added./d/city/nandajie2 is changed, old 1 saved as nandajie2.bak/d/city/npc/qigai,  guidao   are added/d/city/zuixianlou2 is changed, old 1 saved as zuixianlou2.bak/d/city/npc/zhu is changed ( add some chat_msg ) , back up to *.baknote: gudao is modified from es2 Liu-Anru. work same way","time":823327292,"author":"清平剑","title":"new stuff added:",]),(["msg":"once you have only 500 silver (no gold) and then you buy anystuff, like shen in yaopu, all silver disappeared !  dayu report with more then 200 silver and no gold, this bug will definitely happenI will remove the mask for a while, until find a better place :)","author":"清平剑","time":823720854,"title":"about the money system",]),(["msg":"as reported by mike, it's true, I think the net lag or mud oscuaz that, but I temporarily  comment the convert code of qian.cmake sure no one abuse it until you find out why or fix it :)","time":823902118,"author":"清平剑","title":"the money convert bug",]),(["msg":"add no_steal in wumiaoadd a board for gaibang : /clone/board/gaibang_bso /d/city/pomiao.c is modidfied to add the boardadd a \"down\" exit in void, so ppls wont get stuck there when we are updating rooms or npc's.add 2 new rooms : /d/working/workshop1, workshop2as a testing work space for wiz's. feel free to put anything there. or modified it.","author":"清平剑","time":823994577,"title":"more new stuff added :",]),(["msg":"I heard a lot of complains about kong kong. I suggest to modify it:1) I saw three kong kongs. That's not good. we should only have one kong kong.2) Reduce his stealing level from 200 to 100. 3) disable his follow function.Some people complained to me that our wiz abused their right. Althought Idon't believe this, I will suggest our wiz to behave more carefully. Forinstance, wiz shouldn't be involved in the PK arguement.Some people also complained about Wang Wu. I don't know how he was designed.Is he always on or need some tricks to free him just like Liu Anlu in es2 ?If he is always on, that's very bad. He will scare always the new players.So far our mud is very successful. But [A[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[[C[C[C[C[[B[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[A[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[C[[B[D[D[D[A[A[A[B[B[B[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[D[A[A[A[A[A.ne","time":824012736,"author":"方大侠","title":"kong kong",]),(["msg":"I heard a lot of complains about kong kong. I suggest to modify it:1) I saw three kong kongs. That's not good. we should only have one kong kong.2) Reduce his stealing level from 200 to 100.3) disable his follow function.Some people complained to me that our wiz abused their right. Althought Idon't believe this, I will suggest our wiz to behave more carefully. Forinstance, wiz shouldn't be involved in the PK arguement.Some people also complained about Wang Wu. I don't know how he was designed.Is he always on or need some tricks to free him just like Liu Anlu in es2 ?If he is always on, that's very bad. He will scare away the new players.At the beginning we need to attract players to come to play our mud. Butthe design of kong kong and Wang Wu run counter to this, esp. there arenot high level players can kill them now.","time":824013464,"author":"方大侠","title":"kong kong",]),(["msg":"The following is the status of Rock【 平  民 】星宿派第二代弟子 星宿古怪(Rock)  你是一位十六岁的男性人类，丁未年十月十五日卯时二刻生。  膂力：[ 14]  悟性：[ 28]  根骨：[ 24]  身法：[ 27]  你的师父是丁春秋。 战斗攻击力 396 (+5)            战斗防御力 2144 (+1)  你到目前为止总共杀了 438 个人，其中有 1 个是其他玩家。      　神： -48122 潜    能： 15 (99%) 实战经验： 12747星宿古怪目前所学过的技能：   基本轻功 (dodge)                         - 出类拔萃  50/  128  基本内功 (force)                         - 马马虎虎  32/  131□化功大法 (huagong-dafa)                  - 驾轻就熟  45/  739  读书写字 (literate)                      - 马马虎虎  38/  379  基本招架 (parry)                         - 半生不熟  23/  144  基本棒法 (staff)                         - 马马虎虎  30/  928□天山杖法 (tianshan-zhang)                - 驾轻就熟  45/ 1030  基本拳脚 (unarmed)                       - 半生不熟  22/  428□星宿毒掌 (xingxiu-duzhang)               - 马马虎虎  37/  825□摘星功 (zhaixinggong)                    - 出类拔萃  50/ 1075 These are impossible for a player only plays 2d12h. Something wrong.Either one of our wiz abused his right or Rock used the bugs to play.","time":824014861,"author":"方大侠","title":"about Rock",]),(["msg":"and his max neili is 671 !","time":824015293,"author":"方大侠","title":"more about rock",]),(["msg":"changed the name of bamboo sword to zhujian, and changjian in wudangliangongfang to zhu jian.","author":"缥渺魔君","time":824024301,"title":"bamboo sword",]),(["msg":"wang5 has same trigger to be asked and then turn madlike Liu Anru. Just cauz sb know the trigger and keep ask him to let him out :)^Kong kong will be changed back to 100 stealingfollowing may sound too tough for newbies :)I will comment it :)","time":824029754,"author":"清平剑","title":"re: 23",]),(["msg":"i had:□太极拳 (taiji-quan)                      - 粗通皮毛  16/  293after using practice several times. seems like a bug.","author":"草鱼","time":824128747,"title":"practice bug?",]),(["msg":"never mind ... my unarmed was 16","author":"草鱼","time":824128995,"title":"29",]),(["msg":"taiji-jian.c and taiji-quan.c are modified, so all have 8 招  nowtaiji-dao.c is added , 太极刀,   also have 8 招, all of themuse the principle of higher skill lvl, more 招 could be used.I changed the 张松溪 and 张三丰  file, so xi is apprenticableand both of them can teach taiji-dao.  For later developmentxiang please let 太极刀 + 太极剑  special combination available :)double the relative score for those who learned both 2 skills ","time":824359960,"author":"清平剑","title":"some change to wudang :",]),(["msg":"Dts,I talked with cleansword about the jumping tower, we come to two suggestions:1. let the player who jumps out goto one of the 4 results: die, faint, nothing,   and be rewarded. The formular will be(for example):	x = query_skill(\"dodge\") + random(50	if (x < 20) die	else if (20 < x < 60) faint	else if (60 < x < 100) nothing	else if (x > 100) reward1. only two result: die or reward. let the player have 50/50 chance.^--should be 2the award could be: dodge book/dodge+1/...anybody has a better idea?aji","author":"缥渺魔君","time":824368798,"title":"jumping tower of shaolin",]),(["msg":"I think we have a division of design here. I am the designer of wudang,so please don't change anything about wudang's skills and npcs withoutinforming me first. Change back all those modification you have made.Focus on your shaolin design and don't take care other stuffs toomuch. I don't see any emergency to modify wudang's skills and npcs,however, I do see we should set up other classes as soon as possible.","time":824378147,"author":"方大侠","title":"re: some change to wudang",]),(["msg":"by the way, I am also the designer of yangzhou city. If anybody want todo any changes in yangzhou city, ask my agreement first. If there isnot coordination among wizs and any wiz feel he can do anything he wants,this mud will be messed up soon. It was messed several days ago.","time":824378572,"author":"方大侠","title":"more",]),(["msg":"come on guys, please don't fight over this.cleansword added new feature 出于好心:) but really should have informed zhouzi first.. since zhouzi feels wudang and yangzhou are notin urge to be modified, cleansword maybe can save his changes to .bakfiles temporarily? once we decided to add them, then do it.team work is important for we to present a nice game environment,each wiz has their reasons to do the designing :). let's just discusswith each other rather than fighting :).best wishes.Xiang","time":824380052,"author":"翔少爷","title":"re: changes",]),(["msg":"as reported by players, our banker has problem withall \"cun, qu, duihuan\" commands.the banker cannot handle the job properly, which givesplayer a chance to make money.I have fixed the problem by introducing a flag.Qian will process in a slow speed now. please havea try when you have time.there could be another bug :-))Dts","author":"时空","time":824408870,"title":"BUG-FIXED: 钱庄老板",]),(["msg":"thanks for all the fixes.I coded some of the stuff in such a hurry during the christmas time,so bugs is almost a sure thing :). sorry about it. :)Xiang","time":824416457,"author":"翔少爷","title":"20",]),(["msg":"my idea : 50% die, 50% reward;^xiang's idea : 40% die, 40% nothing, 20% reward aji's idea : 25% die, 25% faint, 25% nothing, 25% reward;dts show your point here, so we can make a decision:)whoever want to make a suggestion is welcomed:)","time":824416987,"author":"清平剑","title":"re: 16",]),(["msg":"I updated /feature/dealer.c using dts' method. It servers mostbuying/selling sites, like ping, xiaoer, tang nan.It seems it need to reboot server to make dealer.c in to use.(updatedoesn't work) Whoever has reboot privilige please reboot the serverwhen you see this. So we can bring ping back.aji","author":"缥渺魔君","time":824435364,"title":"dealer.c",]),(["msg":"I prefer aji's idea. more outcomes :)25% die, 25% faint, 25% nothing, 25% reward;... aji provided the protocol code already in another posting--dts","time":824443843,"author":"时空","title":"re: shaolin towers",]),(["msg":"All right, ping has been back from his trip and is much smarter now.I cann't fool him with fast buy any more.aji","author":"缥渺魔君","time":824448312,"title":"ping is back",]),(["msg":"new medicines:/d/city/obj/shouwu.c is added/d/city/obj/lianzi.c is added/d/city/obj/shanshen.c is added/d/city/obj/guiyuan.c is added^/d/city/obj/yangxin.c is added^/d/city/obj/jinchuang.c is changed,  backup jinchuang.bak/d/city/npc/ping.c is changed,  backup ping.bak/d/city/yaopu.c is changed,  backup yaopu.bak/d/city/kedian.c is changed, backup kedian.bak/kungfu/class/shaolin/xingzhe.c is added. /kungfu/skill/cibei-dao.c , shaolin-shenfa.c , hunyuan-yiqi.c is added ","author":"清平剑","time":823590701,"title":"more changes",]),(["msg":"Maybe it's not a good idea to allow players to have the mask.or need to make it hard to get the mask.Xiang","time":823668554,"author":"翔少爷","title":"mask",]),(["msg":"once you have only 500 silver (no gold) and then you buy anystuff, like shen in yaopu, all silver disappeared !  dayu report with more then 200 silver and no gold, this bug will definitely happenI will remove the mask for a while, until find a better place :)","author":"清平剑","time":823720854,"title":"about the money system",]),(["msg":"as reported by mike, it's true, I think the net lag or mud oscuaz that, but I temporarily  comment the convert code of qian.cmake sure no one abuse it until you find out why or fix it :)","time":823902118,"author":"清平剑","title":"the money convert bug",]),(["msg":"add no_steal in wumiaoadd a board for gaibang : /clone/board/gaibang_bso /d/city/pomiao.c is modidfied to add the boardadd a \"down\" exit in void, so ppls wont get stuck there when we are updating rooms or npc's.add 2 new rooms : /d/working/workshop1, workshop2as a testing work space for wiz's. feel free to put anything there. or modified it.","author":"清平剑","time":823994577,"title":"more new stuff added :",]),(["msg":"I heard a lot of complains about kong kong. I suggest to modify it:1) I saw three kong kongs. That's not good. we should only have one kong kong.2) Reduce his stealing level from 200 to 100. 3) disable his follow function.Some people complained to me that our wiz abused their right. Althought Idon't believe this, I will suggest our wiz to behave more carefully. Forinstance, wiz shouldn't be involved in the PK arguement.Some people also complained about Wang Wu. I don't know how he was designed.Is he always on or need some tricks to free him just like Liu Anlu in es2 ?If he is always on, that's ver